  "solution": {
    "text": "A normal vector to the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> plane is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,2</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math><br />A normal vector to the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> plane is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math><br />A vector parallel to the required line <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Equation of the required line is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfy the required line<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math>",
